    {
      "topic": "staff",
      "sentiment": "positive",
      "mentions": 39,
      "title": {
        "en": "Dedicated veterinarians and support team"
      },
      "text": {
        "en": "Clients express high confidence in the clinical team, praising Dr. Matt Lockhart, Dr. Kensington, Dr. Khodadad, Dr. Dumas, and Dr. Goss for their thorough evaluations, compassionate bedside manner, and willingness to answer questions. However, a small number of reviewers noted stressful encounters, citing communication friction with new clients or differing perspectives on care."
      }
    },
    {
      "topic": "results",
      "sentiment": "mixed",
      "mentions": 10,
      "title": {
        "en": "Effective medical treatment and recovery"
      },
      "text": {
        "en": "Pet owners commend the hospital for successful diagnostic work, chronic condition management, and gentle palliative care, with several noting life-saving interventions for older dogs and cats. Conversely, two negative reviews describe disappointing outcomes following clinic visits, including concerns over mobility changes after treatment and ongoing allergy medication issues."
      }
    },
    {
      "topic": "place",
      "sentiment": "positive",
      "mentions": 6,
      "title": {
        "en": "Calm and clean clinical facility"
      },
      "text": {
        "en": "Reviewers describe the hospital as clean, welcoming, and well-managed, highlighting a calm office atmosphere that helps keep nervous pets relaxed during exams. Clients appreciate convenient curbside assistance for individuals with mobility challenges and flexible scheduling options that make visits easy to navigate."
      }
    }
  ],
  "faq": [
    {
