        "en": "Which veterinarians are frequently commended by clients?"
      },
      "a": {
        "en": "Reviewers frequently praise Dr. Matt Lockhart, Dr. Kensington, Dr. Dumas, Dr. Khodadad, and Dr. Goss."
      },
